.TH VIBEOS-CALENDAR-REMINDERS 1 "2026-11-16" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-calendar-reminders \- reminder service of the VibeOS calendar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-calendar-reminders
.SH DESCRIPTION
Notifies at each event reminder with the calendar app closed, and asks vibeos-wakeup to wake the phone for it. It runs as the systemd user service vibeos-calendar-reminders.service and owns vibeos.Calendar.Reminders on the session bus.
.SH SEE ALSO
vibeos-calendar(1), vibeos-wakeup(8)
